  "prefLabel": "Puc 502.11 Person",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 502.11 \"Person\" means an individual, firm, joint venture, partnership, corporation, association, state, cooperative association, or joint stock association, and includes any trustee, receiver, assignee, or personal representative thereof but shall not include a municipality operating a gas system pursuant to RSA 38.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note # 1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Puc 500) #13794, eff 10-25-23",
